msgid "ReliefNT 5.3.4"
msgstr "ReliefNT 5.3.4"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"新增 VirtIO-GPU DRM/KMS，在宿主支持 VirGL 时提供 OpenGL 加速；用新的 DRM/KMS 后端替换旧 VMware SVGA II 驱动，保留兼容 vmwgfx "
"的用户态接口，并改进多种显示设备上的帧缓冲刷新。"
msgstr ""
"Added VirtIO-GPU DRM/KMS with OpenGL acceleration when the host supports VirGL. Replaced the "
"legacy VMware SVGA II driver with a DRM/KMS backend compatible with the vmwgfx userspace "
"interface, and improved framebuffer refresh on multiple display devices."

msgid ""
"新增现代 PCI VirtIO-Block 驱动、RTL8139 和 Intel I225/I226-V 网卡支持；VMXNET3 增加 MSI-X 接收处理，NVMe 和 AHCI "
"增加中断驱动的读完成处理。"
msgstr ""
"Added modern PCI VirtIO-Block, RTL8139 and Intel I225/I226-V support. VMXNET3 gained MSI-X "
"receive processing, and NVMe and AHCI gained interrupt-driven read completion."

msgid ""
"新增 SquashFS 4.0 只读挂载，支持 fragment、扩展属性和 gzip、XZ、Zstd、LZ4、LZO、LZMA 压缩；修复 FAT 大簇读取、ext4 查找重试及文件映射在 "
"I/O 有进展时过早失败的问题。"
msgstr ""
"Added read-only SquashFS 4.0 mounts with fragments, extended attributes, and gzip, XZ, Zstd, LZ4,"
" LZO and LZMA compression. Fixed FAT reads on large clusters, ext4 lookup retries, and premature "
"failures in file-backed mappings while I/O was making progress."

msgid ""
"为原生 x86-64 Linux ABI 增加 pidfd 和经典 BPF 的 seccomp 过滤模式；补齐 PIE 装载、事件描述符、嵌套 epoll、procfs、CPU "
"时钟和资源限制等语义，改善 Java、Electron 等运行时依赖的内核行为。"
msgstr ""
"Added pidfds and classic BPF seccomp filter mode for the native x86-64 Linux ABI. Improved PIE "
"loading, event descriptors, nested epoll, procfs, CPU clocks and resource limits to better match "
"the kernel behavior expected by runtimes such as Java and Electron."

msgid "增加 PTY 包模式和队列清空，修复真实 TTY 的行编辑及终端状态处理；内核日志统一等级与组件标记，默认过滤常规调试信息，运行期 COM1 输出改用队列与中断。"
msgstr ""
"Added PTY packet mode and queue flushing, and fixed line editing and terminal-state handling on "
"real TTYs. Kernel messages now use consistent severity and component labels, suppress routine "
"debug output by default, and use queued, interrupt-driven COM1 output at runtime."

msgid ""
"降低调度器、页缓存和存储路径开销；修复 SMP 下的 FPU 状态交接、写时复制与 mprotect 后的跨核 TLB 同步，以及辅助 CPU 的缓存配置；改善非阻塞 Unix 套接字连接和 "
"IPv6 地址绑定。"
msgstr ""
"Reduced scheduler, page-cache and storage overhead. Fixed SMP FPU handoff, cross-CPU TLB "
"synchronization after copy-on-write and mprotect, and secondary CPU cache configuration. Improved"
" nonblocking Unix socket connections and IPv6 address binding."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid ""
"**是，涉及旧 VMware 显示驱动及内核模块配套。** 不再提供旧 SVGA II 后端；自定义配置需要改用新的 DRM 后端。旧版 "
"``.ko``、``Module.symvers``、模块 SDK 和 initramfs 不应与本版内核混用；现有磁盘不需要转换格式。"
msgstr ""
"**Yes: the legacy VMware display driver and matching kernel modules are affected.** The old SVGA "
"II backend is no longer shipped; switch custom configurations to the new DRM backend. Do not mix "
"this kernel with older ``.ko`` files, ``Module.symvers``, module SDKs or initramfs images. "
"Existing disks do not require format conversion."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Upgrade and migration notes"

msgid "本次为**源码发布**，不附内核、模块或镜像二进制。对已有配置运行 ``olddefconfig``，重新构建内核、模块和 initramfs，并保留一个可启动的回退版本。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **source release**, with no kernel, module or image binaries attached. Run "
"``olddefconfig`` on existing configurations, rebuild the kernel, modules and initramfs, and keep "
"a bootable fallback."

msgid ""
"VirtIO-Block 限于现代 PCI 传输，目前不能作 swap 后端；VirtIO-GPU 不宣称支持 Venus/Vulkan。SquashFS 仅支持只读块设备挂载，seccomp "
"过滤模式不支持严格模式或用户通知。"
msgstr ""
"VirtIO-Block is limited to modern PCI transport and cannot currently back swap; VirtIO-GPU does "
"not claim Venus/Vulkan support. SquashFS supports read-only mounts from block devices only. "
"Seccomp filter mode does not provide strict mode or user notification."

msgid "本次发布检查覆盖版本生成、数字宏、版本后缀、procfs 宿主回归和三语文档；未重新编译完整内核、打包或运行整版 QEMU 回归。**VMware 验证未完成**，也未重新验证实体硬件。"
msgstr ""
"Release checks covered version generation, numeric macros, version suffixes, the host procfs "
"regression and documentation in three languages. The full kernel was not rebuilt, no images were "
"packaged, and no full-release QEMU regression was run. **VMware verification is incomplete**; "
"physical hardware was not retested."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"``configs/build-version`` 的基准值为 **5.3.4**，生成数字字段为 **5/3/4**；``EXTRAVERSION``、``LOCALVERSION`` 与模块"
" ABI 后缀规则不变。pidfd 与 seccomp 是 Linux 扩展，不属于 POSIX。"
msgstr ""
"The base value in ``configs/build-version`` is **5.3.4** and the generated numeric fields are "
"**5/3/4**. Rules for ``EXTRAVERSION``, ``LOCALVERSION`` and the module ABI suffix are unchanged. "
"Pidfds and seccomp are Linux extensions, not POSIX interfaces."

msgid "发布范围为上一版本提交 ``0a4f22a4fb6055ae36d27c6a5544eca6fa599b9a`` 之后至本次版本提交；仅包含 ReliefNT 仓库中的有效更改。"
msgstr ""
"The release covers changes after the previous version commit "
"``0a4f22a4fb6055ae36d27c6a5544eca6fa599b9a`` through this version commit, limited to effective "
"changes in the ReliefNT repository."
